{
  "name": "IIoT - Resumo diário de produção no WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Resumo diário de produção\n\nA plataforma chama este webhook quando um dia de produção fecha (turnos encerrados e a máquina parada há 30 min, hora extra incluída) — **uma mensagem por vez**, das 07h às 21h e com no mínimo 3 min entre envios. Quem acumula os fechamentos das 17h e dá o ritmo é a fila da plataforma; aqui só se envia: o texto e, em seguida, as imagens de produção e de paradas de cada equipamento.\n\n1. Preencha **Configuração**.\n2. Ative e copie a URL de produção do nó **Resumo recebido** para a variável **N8N_SUMMARY_WEBHOOK_URL** da plataforma (Coolify).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "061181b3-c779-46c6-934b-b03edb18653b",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "everlenz-iiot-resumo",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a3913870-ca14-4d1f-94fd-de2754a20209",
      "name": "Resumo recebido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "76ad9aff-cef8-4329-b3c5-30c1f33b010a"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "78b6edd6-31da-4df7-955a-fdf709a7fdd8",
              "name": "PLATAFORMA_URL",
              "value": "https://iotplataform.everlenz.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4cb2171f-d663-4687-ba27-6a5a5d5d401a",
              "name": "PLATAFORMA_CHAVE",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_N8N_API_KEY",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b9a7f429-4d6a-49c1-9c88-a65ca898ad8b",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_URL",
              "value": "https://evolutionapi.assistentedrfin.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "32f3296f-8c4c-4968-b956-7a90c35b350c",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA",
              "value": "NOME_DA_INSTANCIA",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "68415858-7cdf-43e2-bf51-5019214c69fa",
              "name": "EVOLUTION_APIKEY",
              "value": "COLE_AQUI_A_APIKEY_DA_EVOLUTION",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "414eda26-ef5d-44a4-b097-988dcd44d4b2",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "027746ea-0e66-4e6d-a049-33ce881d6d83",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.headers['x-n8n-key'] }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1412bf1a-55d9-4c70-b72b-31e8295a6798",
      "name": "Chave válida?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "22b06412-1d38-4751-bd47-dddad0ff92e7",
      "name": "Ignora",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.waitSeconds || 10 }}"
      },
      "id": "7e8f7e2d-eb62-4b38-96b3-df6a51eb4463",
      "name": "Espera aleatória",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_URL }}/message/sendText/{{ encodeURIComponent($('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_APIKEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "number",
              "value": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.number }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "text",
              "value": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.text }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "delay",
              "value": "={{ 1500 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 2500) }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "presence",
              "value": "composing"
            },
            {
              "name": "linkPreview",
              "value": "={{ false }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "da9646ed-0e37-47f4-a02b-4c5b7f71bf18",
      "name": "Envia resumo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c0a7774b-1c30-4a19-ab20-bcff89e227c0",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.images || []).length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cf26fbbc-2583-47bf-a324-cab883ce4a79",
      "name": "Tem imagens?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Produção e paradas de cada equipamento, na ordem em que a plataforma mandou.\nreturn ($('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.images || []).map((image) => ({ json: image }));"
      },
      "id": "22d21be7-c8fb-4b87-8f21-20933d9af732",
      "name": "Separa imagens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1340,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "81359d83-fad6-4845-a2ed-c83257543949",
      "name": "Uma imagem por vez",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1560,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": "={{ 3 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 4) }}"
      },
      "id": "e424137c-70bf-4695-aada-26ed0c513511",
      "name": "Pausa entre imagens",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1780,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_URL }}/message/sendMedia/{{ encodeURIComponent($('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_INSTANCIA) }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.EVOLUTION_APIKEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { number: $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.number, mediatype: 'image', mimetype: $json.mimetype, caption: $json.caption, media: $json.base64, fileName: $json.fileName } }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "63d29df7-6962-4b6d-9df9-fad862d4ca1f",
      "name": "Envia imagem",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2000,
        -120
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.resultUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-n8n-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ok: true } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7fa70dbd-6a24-474d-86ab-60a4713ec3ea",
      "name": "Confirma envio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Resumo recebido').first().json.body.resultUrl }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-n8n-key",
              "value": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.PLATAFORMA_CHAVE }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ok: false, error: String($json.error?.message ?? $json.message ?? 'falha na Evolution').slice(0, 400) } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6145fa11-9710-4c32-8365-05c514c69a8f",
      "name": "Registra falha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        120
      ]
    }
